    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Lonely Journey...</h2>Awaken from your deep sleep and explore a world in darkness. Find enchanted amulets, incredible magics, face powerful enemies, overcome deadly traps, use the sword you possess to fight and make your way to your destiny.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/b18570850a5d76b9e2a5b8d33e96643b.poster.avif?t=1741215676\" width=630 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/b18570850a5d76b9e2a5b8d33e96643b.webm?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/b18570850a5d76b9e2a5b8d33e96643b.mp4?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tiny Metroidvania, Hack And Slash And More!</h2>Mother's Sword is a 2D platformer with small Metroidvania elements. Face enemies in fast and precise hack and slash combat. Collect Energy Points to unlock new sword abilities.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/de02fdc4743ae057eced1e88c7ea4d89.poster.avif?t=1741215676\" width=630 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/de02fdc4743ae057eced1e88c7ea4d89.webm?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/de02fdc4743ae057eced1e88c7ea4d89.mp4?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find Amulets and Magics with exceptional abilities, giving you unique skills to use in combat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Learn new skills to explore and fight your enemies, use your knowledge to perform incredible combos.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/aa26cb36ed984c4380869c437210dde8.poster.avif?t=1741215676\" width=630 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/aa26cb36ed984c4380869c437210dde8.webm?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/aa26cb36ed984c4380869c437210dde8.mp4?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Lonely Journey...</h2>Awaken from your deep sleep and explore a world in darkness. Find enchanted amulets, incredible magics, face powerful enemies, overcome deadly traps, use the sword you possess to fight and make your way to your destiny.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/b18570850a5d76b9e2a5b8d33e96643b.poster.avif?t=1741215676\" width=630 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/b18570850a5d76b9e2a5b8d33e96643b.webm?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/b18570850a5d76b9e2a5b8d33e96643b.mp4?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tiny Metroidvania, Hack And Slash And More!</h2>Mother's Sword is a 2D platformer with small Metroidvania elements. Face enemies in fast and precise hack and slash combat. Collect Energy Points to unlock new sword abilities.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/de02fdc4743ae057eced1e88c7ea4d89.poster.avif?t=1741215676\" width=630 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/de02fdc4743ae057eced1e88c7ea4d89.webm?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/de02fdc4743ae057eced1e88c7ea4d89.mp4?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find Amulets and Magics with exceptional abilities, giving you unique skills to use in combat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Learn new skills to explore and fight your enemies, use your knowledge to perform incredible combos.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/aa26cb36ed984c4380869c437210dde8.poster.avif?t=1741215676\" width=630 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/aa26cb36ed984c4380869c437210dde8.webm?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890370/extras/aa26cb36ed984c4380869c437210dde8.mp4?t=1741215676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
